# The frustum of testdata/topo/frustum.tlspr, the circle its top's rim
# traces picked on the turned view and rounded; the same as
# path_fillet_cone.go makes (TestPathEquivalenceFilletCone).
file $testdata/topo/frustum.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
move 370 295
down L 370 295
up L 370 295
menu Features|Fillet Edges
